# Alembic : database migration
* this alembic is needed for SQLAlchemy and python ecosystem.
* this is needed to migrate or make changes in database as similar to git
* For eg: if we add any column  using SQL commands this does not make changes to prod-db or risk of breaking data
* alembic solves this by: we can track changes, update without losing existing data, can easily roll back if there is problem
